WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.883
OpenAI is fighting

00:00:01.694 --> 00:00:03.038
copycats that strip

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:03.769
safeguards

00:00:04.302 --> 00:00:05.811
OpenAI says bad

00:00:05.635 --> 00:00:07.085
actors use frontier

00:00:06.896 --> 00:00:08.311
model outputs without

00:00:08.123 --> 00:00:08.865
permission

00:00:08.936 --> 00:00:10.068
to train copies

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:11.153
that lack comparable

00:00:10.965 --> 00:00:11.860
safeguards

00:00:12.382 --> 00:00:13.301
For example

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:14.457
someone could distill

00:00:14.269 --> 00:00:15.271
