00:00:15.082 --> 00:00:15.978
skills into a

00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:17.087
copy that helps

00:00:16.898 --> 00:00:17.759
with attacks the

00:00:17.571 --> 00:00:19.080
original would refuse

00:00:19.598 --> 00:00:21.626
OpenAI combines adversarial

00:00:21.438 --> 00:00:22.098
testing

00:00:22.204 --> 00:00:24.102
model training classifiers

00:00:23.914 --> 00:00:25.435
and API protections

00:00:25.247 --> 00:00:26.461
with investigations

00:00:26.614 --> 00:00:27.876
has hardened protections

00:00:27.688 --> 00:00:28.572
for its models'

00:00:28.383 --> 00:00:29.043
reasoning

00:00:29.197 --> 00:00:30.105
and is sharing

00:00:29.916 --> 00:00:30.765
lessons with the

00:00:30.577 --> 00:00:31.378
industry

00:00:31.517 --> 00:00:32.378
The post was

00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:34.111
published on November 20

00:00:34.638 --> 00:00:35.652
Full story on

00:00:35.463 --> 00:00:36.359
